  story: 'For centuries the empire had been fragmented.

    Factions waged war endlessly
    against eachother.


    Then a descendant of the royal bloodline was found.

    A
    young boy was crowned the Enlightened Ruler.


    Old ways were outlawed; the
    caste system abolished.

    The end of a way of life had begun.


    The Bushido
    Coda.'
